Aladdin Connect Cloud for Home Assistant

This is an independent Python port of the Apache-2.0 project:
https://github.com/homebridge-plugins/homebridge-aladdin-connect
Source revision: 2fe528a525ffacf5d435569d50a7cf2e4daa87f8 (package 4.3.4).

The original project and its contributors retain their rights. This package
retains the original Apache License 2.0. API endpoints, Cognito app credentials,
door status values, and battery conventions are derived from the original code.

Changes: replaced TypeScript/Homebridge with Python/Home Assistant; introduced
async I/O, config and options flows, HA coordinator entities, authentication
recovery, command-delivery error handling, translations, and automated tests.

This package is not an official Genie or Home Assistant integration. It uses
the Genie cloud and does not implement a local/LAN device protocol. The upstream
Homebridge repository is a source reference, not this port's support tracker.
